{"title":"USPS Announces Goodnight Moon Stamps","link":"https://kottke.org/25/01/usps-announces-goodnight-moon-stamps","date":1737478874000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/goodnight-moon-usps-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/goodnight-moon-usps-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/goodnight-moon-usps-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"690\" alt=\"a stamp sheet with scenes from Goodnight Moon\" /></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://about.usps.com/newsroom/national-releases/2025/0113-goodnight-moon-and-spongebob-squarepants-stamps-to-be-issued-later-this-year.htm\">The USPS has announced</a> that they will be issuing stamps based on the children’s classic <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0694003611/ref=nosim/0sil8\">Goodnight Moon</a>, written by Margaret Wise Brown, illustrated by Clement Hurd, and first published in 1947.</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/goodnight-moon-usps-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/goodnight-moon-usps-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/goodnight-moon-usps-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1086\" height=\"1068\" alt=\"a stamp sheet with scenes from Goodnight Moon\" /></p>\n\n<p>The Postal Service notes that “these designs are preliminary and may change”. Goodnight Moon was the very first bedtime book for our kids — we read it to them so so so many times. I will be buying some of these stamps for sure.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/books\">books</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Goodnight%20Moon\">Goodnight Moon</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/stamps\">stamps</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/USPS\">USPS</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/01/usps-announces-goodnight-moon-stamps\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"c76b8d5abf903425ad186f45b63978648f6f26dbf13f26f41272a1dfb21d1c72","category":"Sites"}